n things that can obliterate the boundary between reality and insanity. And if even one of those objects gets out of the station, it will mark the end of the world as we know it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hardcore tactical battle system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395320/extras/7fecfc05ebb0c81496f95110105d9f07.poster.avif?t=1771448018\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395320/extras/7fecfc05ebb0c81496f95110105d9f07.webm?t=1771448018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395320/extras/7fecfc05ebb0c81496f95110105d9f07.mp4?t=1771448018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a squad created to solve impossible problems. Use dozens of unique abilities and develop new skills. Explore the area, bolster your arsenal and your gear, but don't forget that your greatest weapon is a sharp mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are limited, and every cartridge could be worth its weight in gold. Study the battlefield and your enemies carefully to understand the most effective course of action. Awaiting you in the game is a fair fighting system, so you won't have to worry about misses with a 99% hit chance. Just think carefully and win!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Factions and enemies<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395320/extras/b70b9f3c39f191335d4159f784f9d1b3.poster.avif?t=1771448018\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395320/extras/b70b9f3c39f191335d4159f784f9d1b3.webm?t=1771448018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://